    },
    "summary": "A hidden model behind **dense terrain features** has **gone to ground** as long as:\n\n- it is hidden\n- intervening dense terrain features keep it from being **fully visible** to the model attacking it\n- its unit made no ranged attacks this turn or the previous turn\n\nWhile it has gone to ground, its **detection range** is 3\" shorter.",
